 "notes": "Printed page 194. Part A continues across leaves 192-200; this leaf covers Chittagong Hill Tracts District, Cooch Behar State and Tripura State. Chittagong Hill Tracts, Santali (48, italic) Both sexes is printed with a damaged middle digit that reads as '360'; Males 195 + Females 105 = 300 and Kherwari (38) = 300, so the intended figure is evidently 300. Recorded as '?' (damaged digit) rather than 360: the province total (All Districts and States, Santali 764,729) also requires 300 here, since the sum of all districts is 60 too high with 360. Tripura Bengali Females printed '75 900' (space for comma) = 75,900. Tripura Arabic (81) Females cell is blank (no nil dots); treated as nil."
